&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQ1gdeOLNoEsm2xDroWukiwGs3g&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gy4ydICWpol34Hxzjdhu4zdVshg&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlg3mcORF1NVAJz6k4p0Ttqnm&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;MQN2dU2jgoLb71xVQ4Wl7gCbgig&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fodtd0zPio4oK7xkRHqlQXV3g0b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and develop strategies and product enhancements for the global P2P business (ex-Hong Kong) to align with business growth objectives and drive their implementation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tv6tdbhcMosQ1ZxI4EQl4eIOgkg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish effective growth strategies by integrating real business scenarios with data analysis; gain in-depth understanding of global P2P market characteristics, address user needs and pain points across each market, and enhance product usability and overall user experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H6n3dGezUocxS3xiDRIlTvt5gmf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build a user risk control and quality management system, establish standardized user operations mechanisms, identify high-risk user profiles through effective risk control strategies, and drive the refinement and upgrade of risk control models.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZvMudyh2EoSRsyxYXkglXdpsgjd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain strong data sensitivity and establish a comprehensive business funnel data analysis framework; stay current with industry and market trends, continuously produce analytical reports and actionable strategies, and provide guidance for product upgrades and business direction.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;MQN2dU2jgoLb71xVQ4Wl7gCbgig&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WQ8sdk4jcoJIDlxA6IKlCP94gnd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;为非香港全球P2P业务设计和制定符合业务发展的策略和技术功能，并推进落地执行；&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vpatdktbzolzp5xQX2Bl7nLJgqc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;建立有效的业务增长策略，能够结合业务实际场景和数据分析进行综合应用；同时深入了解全球P2P市场的特性，解决每个市场用户需求和痛点，打造产品易用性和用户体验；&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C6DrdkTGIoSdQUxAjvSljS8wgdd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;搭建用户风控和质量管理体系，建立标准化的用户运营机制，通过有效的风控策略识别出高危用户特征，驱动风控模型完善与升级；&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CJGYdZkyLoEfk2xBnvhlmIZBg9g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;对数据保持敏感性，建立完善的业务漏斗数据分析体系，能够快速了解行业市场动态，并持续输出分析报告和对应打法，为产品升级及业务方向提供指导性意见&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgaXTwEfSvi4pYESWyVE9IMc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgaXTwEfSvi4pYESWyVE9IMc&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;MQN2dU2jgoLb71xVQ4Wl7gCbgig&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UFXWdFDxlopAM3xnolLlIKxqgXf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above; candidates with 7+ years of experience in internet finance, blockchain, or digital currency-related industries are preferred, as are those with extensive operations management experience and exposure to multiple global markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DBMLdszPFoGXDDxD4RylAWuIg5b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
