&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SVCJd0WBboGZLVxgd2Xl5cv1gVe&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Senior Growth Manager, the Growth Manager will be responsible for driving user acquisition, retention, and revenue growth across multiple marketing channels. This is a hands-on individual contributor role requiring strong execution capabilities, commercial acumen, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QtIUdyq4bo3MnHxN9b4loz5CgIe&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
