&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;125fkfq&quot; data-start=&quot;2024&quot; data-end=&quot;2156&quot;&gt;Experience leading engineering teams responsible for Web3, crypto, fintech, DeFi, NFT, GameFi, or digital asset products at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;l92zf2&quot; data-start=&quot;2157&quot; data-end=&quot;2290&quot;&gt;Familiarity with blockchain security, custody solutions, MPC wallets, account abstraction, and emerging decentralized technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v1d689&quot; data-start=&quot;2291&quot; data-end=&quot;2436&quot;&gt;Experience building globally distributed engineering organizations and delivering products across multiple markets and regulatory environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1d3irdz&quot; data-start=&quot;2437&quot; data-end=&quot;2580&quot;&gt;Active involvement in the Web3 ecosystem through industry contributions, speaking engagements, open-source projects, or community leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
